        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lin San Chi is named a rank four demonic Gu Master skilled in the metal path and also an earth path Gu Master. Narration calls his metal and earth specialty renowned through the land.",
      "chapters": [
        339
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lin_san_chi",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Qin Bai Sheng’s auction, metal, wood, water, fire, and earth are named the five most mainstream paths, more popular than cloud path and sound path, and metal path Immortal Gu draw heated bidding.",
      "chapters": [
        752
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortal Five Elements Grandmaster at rank eight wins a bid using a rank seven metal path Immortal Gu and a rank six metal path Immortal Gu plus immortal materials. His cultivation includes the five paths of metal, wood, water, fire, and earth, so he holds metal path Immortal Gu. As a metal path Gu Immortal, Qin Bai Sheng requests a rank seven metal path Immortal Gu as the base bid for another item, and Fang Yuan cannot compete for such lots because he has no metal path Immortal Gu.",
